# CORAS risk diagram: unwanted incidents collapsed into named risks.
# A risk may be initiated by a threat or an unwanted incident, and harms an
# asset. This is the view you show management.

diagram "Risk overview"

threat    "Insider"                            as ins
incident  "Personal data copied to a USB stick" as usb
risk      "R1: leak of personal data"          as r1
risk      "R2: extended outage"                as r2
asset     "Personal data"                      as pd
asset     "Service uptime"                     as up
treatment "Data loss prevention"               as dlp
comment   "Reviewed at the risk workshop"      as note

ins -> r1
ins -> r2
usb -> r1   "likely"
r1  -> pd   "major"
r2  -> up   "moderate"
dlp -> usb
note -> r1
